{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16895","headline":"出塞作 · 武元衡","name":"出塞作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夙驾逾人境，长驱出塞垣。\n边风引去骑，胡沙拂征辕。\n奏笳山月白，结阵瘴云昏。\n虽云风景异华夏，亦喜地理通楼烦。\n白羽矢飞先火礮，黄金甲耀夺朝暾。\n要须洒扫龙沙净，归谒明光一报恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}